OL,3,GNEWSAFrom ads to The Gentlemen red
OL,4,Acarpet - training dogs for TV
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who works as an on-set animal
OL,7,Fhandler and trainer for TV, adverts and
OL,8,Fevents said it all began with her own
OL,9,Fdog being randomly scouted for a
OL,10,Fcommercial.
OL,12,FKatie Frimston describes herself as
OL,13,F"animal mad and obsessed" and owns
OL,14,Feleven terriers, many of which are also
OL,15,Fshow dogs. "If you ever see a Welsh
OL,16,FTerrier on the TV, or in commercials or
OL,17,Fmagazines, it's usually one of mine,"
OL,18,Fsaid the 32-year-old from Crewe,
OL,19,FCheshire,
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
