OL,3,GNEWSAFrom ads to The Gentlemen red
OL,4,Acarpet - training dogs for TV
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer seven-year-old Welsh Terrier, Bear,
OL,7,Fhas now appeared in adverts for brands
OL,8,Fincluding Aldi, Boden and Northern
OL,9,FTrains.
OL,11,FFrimston also manages other people's
OL,12,Fanimals on set, including two
OL,13,FDobermanns at the recent premiere of
OL,14,FNetflix's The Gentlemen.
